From 7c0f5a1e6b3d4a2f9e8c1d0b5a4f3e2d1c0b9a87 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kevin Zhuang <kevin.zhuang@focalcrest.com>
Date: Sun, 21 Sep 2026 14:20:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] drm/bridge: dw-hdmi-qp: select SND_SOC_HDMI_CODEC

dw-hdmi-qp advertises DRM_BRIDGE_OP_HDMI_AUDIO and fills in
hdmi_audio_dev, so drm_connector_hdmi_audio_init() registers an
"hdmi-audio-codec" platform device parented to the HDMI controller. The
driver that binds that device is sound/soc/codecs/hdmi-codec.c, built
under SND_SOC_HDMI_CODEC.

SND_SOC_HDMI_CODEC has no prompt and can only be reached through a
select. In this directory the only symbol selecting it is
DRM_DW_HDMI_I2S_AUDIO, which depends on the legacy DRM_DW_HDMI
controller. A configuration that enables the QP controller without the
legacy one therefore builds the DRM half of the audio path and leaves
the ASoC half out: the codec platform device is created and never
claimed by any driver.

Every board that wires its HDMI as a simple-audio-card codec then fails
to bring the card up. snd_soc_get_dlc() walks the registered components
looking for one whose of_node matches the sound-dai phandle, finds
none, and returns -EPROBE_DEFER; simple_probe() passes that to
dev_err_probe(), which records the string shared by all of its exit
paths. The result is a card that never registers, reported as

  platform hdmi0-sound: deferred probe pending: asoc-simple-card: parse error

which names neither the missing driver nor the real error code.

Observed on a Mixtile Blade 3 (RK3588) running 6.18.35 with
ROCKCHIP_DW_HDMI_QP=y and ROCKCHIP_DW_HDMI unset. On that kernel
/sys/bus/platform/devices/hdmi-audio-codec.0.auto exists with the
correct parent of_node and no driver bound, while the CPU side
(rockchip-i2s-tdm) probes fine.

Select the codec the same way the legacy controller does, so enabling
the QP controller is enough to get a working HDMI audio path.

Signed-off-by: Kevin Zhuang <kevin.zhuang@focalcrest.com>
---
Upstream-Status: Pending

 drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/Kconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/Kconfig b/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/Kconfig
index 1160aa1d1..2f4c8b3e7 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/Kconfig
@@ -60,6 +60,7 @@ config DRM_DW_HDMI_QP
 	select DRM_DISPLAY_HELPER
 	select DRM_KMS_HELPER
 	select REGMAP_MMIO
+	select SND_SOC_HDMI_CODEC if SND_SOC
 
 config DRM_DW_MIPI_DSI
 	tristate
